WEBVTT

00:06:28.867 --> 00:06:30.348
It is done elsewhere,

00:06:30.372 --> 00:06:32.650
probably not to the degree that we do it,

00:06:32.674 --> 00:06:34.675
but it adds a lot
of margin to the vehicle,

00:06:34.699 --> 00:06:36.917
which obviously adds reliability.

00:06:36.941 --> 00:06:41.377
CA: Gwynne, you became President
of SpaceX 10 years ago, I think.

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:44.916
What's it been like to work
so closely with Elon Musk?

00:06:45.408 --> 00:06:47.855
GS: So I love working for Elon.

00:06:47.879 --> 00:06:50.340
I've been doing it for 16 years
this year, actually.

00:06:50.364 --> 00:06:53.799
I don't think I'm dumb enough
to do something for 16 years

00:06:53.823 --> 00:06:55.799
that I don't like doing.

00:06:55.823 --> 00:06:57.743
He's funny

00:06:57.767 --> 00:07:00.915
and fundamentally without
him saying anything